  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Named for the blue chrome that adorns the body of the original models of this pistol, the Bluebolt Blaster Pistol is much larger than a normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Pistol\" title=\"Blaster Pistol\">Blaster Pistol</a>. However, the weapon is balanced with a heavy grip and a light barrel, making it easy to wield in one hand. Deliah Blue uses a Bluebolt Blaster Pistol. </p><p>The Bluebolt Blaster Pistol can <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> targets as far as away as 8 squares (instead of the usual 6-square range). However, the weapon consumes one additional shot with each <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> attack. </p><p>A Bluebolt Blaster Pistol requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 50 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p><p><b>Inaccurate:</b> This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
